- He sure does.


00:30:45.677 --> 00:30:46.887
Stop it.
- You want.


00:30:47.637 --> 00:30:49.598
Let's go, have some fun.


00:30:49.723 --> 00:30:51.933
You're just not hot enough.


00:30:52.059 --> 00:30:53.477
Hey, stop it!


00:30:53.602 --> 00:30:55.354
Shut your mouth...


00:30:55.479 --> 00:30:56.855
