00:30:56.980 --> 00:30:59.358
Can't be that hard, right?


00:31:00.275 --> 00:31:02.027
Fuck? Fuck.


00:32:22.941 --> 00:32:24.443
I bought breakfast.


00:32:25.986 --> 00:32:27.571
Wanna try?


00:32:29.698 --> 00:32:31.575
