00:32:32.451 --> 00:32:33.827
No eggs.


00:32:36.538 --> 00:32:38.206
Ham?


00:32:38.331 --> 00:32:39.833
No meat.


00:32:45.964 --> 00:32:47.466
Cheese?


00:32:50.677 --> 00:32:52.429
