00:34:17.347 --> 00:34:19.057
Without a passport...


00:34:20.016 --> 00:34:21.851
No passport, huh?


00:34:23.562 --> 00:34:26.106
No money, no work.


00:34:26.231 --> 00:34:28.024
No job, no nothing.


00:34:29.651 --> 00:34:32.404
You don't want to deal,
