00:41:08.174 --> 00:41:10.927
But does that make them bad people?


00:41:11.052 --> 00:41:13.346
Life's not that simple.


00:41:16.766 --> 00:41:18.434
My brother...


00:41:19.185 --> 00:41:20.645
Francis.


00:41:22.814 --> 00:41:25.108
