00:42:16.492 --> 00:42:19.203
My son, my son, what have you done?


00:43:26.979 --> 00:43:29.023
Stop it, Francis! This is Pums.


00:43:29.148 --> 00:43:30.983
This is Pums.


00:43:31.109 --> 00:43:33.236
Thank you, Pums, thank you.


