01:29:30.532 --> 01:29:32.742
I'm good at what I do.


01:29:33.326 --> 01:29:36.079
I'm always careful, you know?


01:29:38.290 --> 01:29:39.541
Cheers.


01:29:39.666 --> 01:29:41.126
Cheers.


01:29:47.424 --> 01:29:49.426
