01:31:23.186 --> 01:31:24.813
It was my fault.


01:31:24.938 --> 01:31:26.815
Your fault?


01:31:28.400 --> 01:31:30.652
My fault.
- Why?


01:31:33.989 --> 01:31:36.783
You don't push what you love, do you?


01:31:51.548 --> 01:31:56.136
You men are actually...
